Context: **T1.1.1** The Connection Conditions to the Transmission System (T1) specify the minimum technical, design, and operational specifications with which every User connected or seeking to connect to the Transmission System must comply, the terminology and nomenclature of Facilities and Equipment, technical standards, performance standards, and data requirements. Furthermore, the Connection Conditions to the Transmission System specify the minimum technical, design, and operational specifications with which the Transmission System Operator of Cyprus (TSOC) shall comply regarding the portion of the Transmission System at the Connection Site, so that Users and prospective Users can design their Facilities and Equipment and install appropriate control systems and protection devices for their Facilities.
**T1.3.1** T1 applies to the Transmission System Operator of Cyprus (TSOC) and to Users, who within T1 include:

* **(a)** Generators, for Generating Units connected to the Transmission System as well as for Generating Units connected to the Distribution System for which a Connection Agreement has been concluded with TSOC;
* **(b)** Consumers connected to the Transmission System;
* **(c)** Transmission System Owner;
* **(d)** Distribution System Operator;
* **(e)** Storage Facility Operators connected to the Transmission System.

