Context: **T10.6.4.1** The De-energisation of the Facilities and Equipment of a User may take place at any time and to any extent that the Transmission System Operator of Cyprus (TSOC) reasonably considers necessary to ensure the safe and reliable operation of the Transmission System within defined specifications.
* **(a)** danger to personnel safety;
